OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA drier and
OL,6,Fsomewhat brighter evening as rain
OL,7,Fclears to the south. Some clear spells
OL,8,Ffor a time, before further cloud and
OL,9,Frain pushes in from the west after
OL,10,Fmidnight. Winds increasing overnight
OL,11,Fespecially around coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,14,Fday with brisk winds. Rain will ease a
OL,15,Flittle into the afternoon, becoming
OL,16,Fmore showery with a chance of brighter
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
