OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely cloudy on Monday and Tuesday
OL,7,Fwith showers possible at times.
OL,8,FPossibly turning brighter Tuesday
OL,9,Fevening and into Wednesday and turning
OL,10,Fincreasingly warm.
